  "title": "Baked Stuffed Apple",
  "description": "An apple is filled with a cinnamon cheesecake center. I used a Braeburn apple but any variety will work. Great for a cold night! Serve with whipped cream or a scoop of vanilla ice cream.",
  "authors": [
    "Emily"
  ],
  "date_published": "2020-06-18T23:34:05-04:00",
